<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SYLVAN STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SYLVAN STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Wednesday it started coverage of Sylvan Learning Systems Inc with an accumulate rating in the intermediate term and a buy rating for the long term.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/8 to 37-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
